From 0205ab102cfb884fd006c1aaca55aea1eb222d97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xaver Hugl <xaver.hugl@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Sep 2024 18:01:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] core/colorspace: add YUV coefficients to ColorDescription

This moves the YUV->RGB matrix from hardcoded values in the shader and in the drm backend
to being specified by the SurfaceItem / the Wayland surface. With that, Wayland clients can
specify the coefficients and we can support additional formats vs. just NV12.
---
